      "id": "claim_5f4d92553d9f4649b89ce75485ca18ba",
      "statement": "The SANDMAN skill-invocation convention layers on A2A 1.0 (JSON-RPC binding): the skill id is passed in message.metadata['sandman.skill'], the input is exactly one data part validated against the skill's inputSchema, and the result is a task artifact named 'result' with one data part validated against the outputSchema.",
